3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 JAN 1786
2 PLAC Räisälänranta Estate
2 ADDR
3 CITY Joroinen
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 NOV 1835
2 ADDR
