2 CONC er student?) at the Fortifications. Sergeant at Alfta company the 22nd May 1746. Entered 1747 the 13th January a Christian marriage with his the 6th April 1796 by death departed wife Maria Magdalena Wahrman. Their 43 years of livi
2 CONC ng together has been blessed by God with 6 children, 4 sons and 2 daughters, of which 1 son has died before this. Had a calm and respectable life. Died of old age weakness. Given(?) to the church (or burial fee?) 24 skilling(?). D
